WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Collapsing Memory-Void, desperate.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.300 align:center
Lyra: Falling. Again.

3
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.600 align:center
Lyra: No ground. Just… pieces.

4
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.900 align:center
Kael: It… knows… where you fall.

5
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.200 align:center
Lyra: It's not random. It's… aiming.

6
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Precarious Ledge of Childhood Room Memory, urgent.

7
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:20.800 align:center
Lyra: There! The window frame.

8
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:22.100 align:center
Lyra: My room. Childhood.

9
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.400 align:center
Kael: A core… piece. Don't… lose it.

10
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:25.700 align:center
Lyra: Got it! Almost.

11
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Collapsing Corridor of Home Memory, tense.

12
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:33.300 align:center
Lyra: Collapse. Now?

13
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Predictable. Your attachments are… obvious.

14
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:36.900 align:center
Lyra: It knew. How?

15
00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.200 align:center
Lyra: Run! Faster!

16
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.500 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Twisted Memory-Hallway, urgent.

17
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.800 align:center
Lyra: Twisted. My old street.

18
00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.100 align:center
Kael: Familiarity… a trap.

19
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.400 align:center
Lyra: This isn't home. Not anymore.

20
00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:48.700 align:center
Lyra: Almost through.

21
00:00:49.1000 --> 00:00:52.1000 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Memory-Library of Twisted Knowledge, desperate.

22
00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:56.300 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: A futile gesture. This memory is… weak.

23
00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:58.600 align:center
Lyra: No! Not that one!

24
00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:00.900 align:center
Lyra: It bought me seconds.

25
00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:03.200 align:center
Kael: A small… piece. Lost.

26
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.500 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in Wall of Repressed Fears, dread.

27
00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:10.800 align:center
Lyra: A wall. Made of… what?

28
00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:13.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Your deepest fears. We know them.

29
00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:14.400 align:center
Lyra: No. Not real.

30
00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:16.700 align:center
Kael: The silence… hears… your thoughts.

31
00:01:17.1000 --> 00:01:20.1000 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in Shifting Fear-Labyrinth, tense.

32
00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:22.300 align:center
Lyra: Shifting. Always shifting.

33
00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:24.600 align:center
Lyra: It's learning my pace.

34
00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:26.900 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Predictable patterns. We adapt.

35
00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:28.200 align:center
Lyra: Can't… stop.

36
00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:33.500 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Threshold of the Core Memory, dread.

37
00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:35.800 align:center
Lyra: The core. Almost there.

38
00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:38.100 align:center
Kael: Your home… your anchor.

39
00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:40.400 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: No sanctuary. Only… absorption.

40
00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.700 align:center
Lyra: Not without a fight.

41
00:01:43.1000 --> 00:01:47.1000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The Core Memory Chamber, dread.

42
00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:49.300 align:center
Lyra: Stop! Leave it!

43
00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:52.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: This 'home' is chaos. We bring order.

44
00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:54.900 align:center
Lyra: It's mine! My place!

45
00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:57.200 align:center
Kael: It feels… no loss.

46
00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:03.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Core Memory Chamber - Confrontation, desperate.

47
00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:05.800 align:center
Lyra: This is for you. Always.

48
00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:07.100 align:center
Lyra: Remember this!

49
00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:08.400 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: A flicker. Insignificant.

50
00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:10.700 align:center
Lyra: No! It has to work!

51
00:02:11.1000 --> 00:02:16.1000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Core Memory Chamber - Aftermath, dread.

52
00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:19.300 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: You are a vessel. For us.

53
00:02:19.600 --> 00:02:20.600 align:center
Lyra: What? No!

54
00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:22.900 align:center
Kael: It wants… your path.

55
00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:26.200 align:center
Lyra: It's following me. Where I go… it knows.
